Battle City homebrew cartridge implementation. Project code is under GPL-2.0.
Battle City (1985) is a NAMCO title. Stage layouts and enemy queues are
compiled from the repository's web/src/data/original.ts catalogue.
Sound cue data is compiled from the repository's web/src/platform/audio-cues.ts
catalogue, transcribed from the Battle City sound bank as attributed there.
The NES APU playback code is implemented in this project. Combat behaviour
was measured with scripted controller input against the Famicom program.
Stage-one graphic shapes and colours were compared with Nintendo's public
NAMCO MUSEUM ARCHIVES Volume 2 Switch screenshot, image 01. The graphics
are assembled by this project's tile generator. Research cartridge images
are not part of the distribution.
The build uses cc65's runtime library. Its license is reproduced below.
